<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28012" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δοξ-αστός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>matter of opinion, conjectural,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νοητός,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				534a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.1114c
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γνωστός,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				478b
			</span></i>, etc.; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιστητός,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>APo.</u>
				88b30
			</span></i>; opp. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁρατός, δ. θεός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.756d
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συλλαβὰς . . ἀληθεῖ δόξῃ δοξαστάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Tht.</u>
					202b
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τροφὴ δοξαστή</span> food <i>of
				opinion,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Phdr.</u>
				248b
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>M.</u>
					2.53
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>glorified,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>De.</u>
				26.19
			</span></i>; <i>held in honour,</i> prob. in <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Decent.</u>
				18
			</span></i>.</div>
